  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGU &#x2013; Aqualia Green Bond Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Georgia Global Utilities JSC (GGU) will issue up to $300 million of 5-year green bonds with a bullet repayment that will be listed on Euronext Dublin. The proceeds of the issuance will be used to (i) refinance the existing shareholder debt (from FCC Aqualia S.A. used to prepay the 2020 green bond), and (ii) finance capital expenditure to rehabilitate the water supply network in Tbilisi and neighboring municipalities.</narrative>
  </description>
